{"asset_key":"ep2/quest_story_12244150","episode":"ep2","category":"quest_story","story_id":"12244150","schema_version":1,"lang":"jp","texts":{"say:2:1224415001:1":{"text":"ルカさん、アクアラ村の皆さんとの話し合いは順調ですか？","source_cn":"卢卡先生，小水村的人谈下来长期合作了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF3F40D7F38145A96","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:3:1224415002:1":{"text":"ああ、うまくいってる。","source_cn":"还行。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x93EC901B6F9EE5EF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:4:1224415003:1":{"text":"判決に満足したようで、協力のことも承諾してくれた。","source_cn":"她们满意审判，我们定下了合作计划。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3F3B6A4F05305685","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:7:1224415004:1":{"text":"素晴らしいです！それならもう、シンドバッドさんが出る幕もありませんね！","source_cn":"那太好了，看来用不上辛巴达去劝她们了！","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xF533FEEB9FE40199","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:8:1224415005:1":{"text":"いや、まだ一つある。","source_cn":"还有另一件事。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3B26254E8A4BD38C","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:9:1224415006:1":{"text":"船の修理が完了したら、次は先遣隊に航路の開拓をしてもらうつもりだ。","source_cn":"船只修理全部完成之后，我们会派先遣队出航，先去探探路。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9C1DD51DA712FD88","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:10:1224415007:1":{"text":"この件について、ボスはお前たちの意見を聞きたがってる。","source_cn":"这件事，索尼娅让我问问你们的意见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A223204DE1A4A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"choice_prompt:11:1224415007":{"text":"この件について、ボスはお前たちの意見を聞きたがってる。","source_cn":"这件事，索尼娅让我问问你们的意见。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x69A223204DE1A4A8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:12:1224415008:1":{"text":"聖石町？","source_cn":"圣石镇？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xC04C12F6D42AF925","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:13:1224415009:1":{"text":"そうです！そこの保安官であるホーガン将軍はマスターの友人！彼の協力があれば、商談もスムーズにまとまるはずです！","source_cn":"没错！那里的治安官，霍根将军，是主人的朋友！有了他的帮...","status":"matched_runtime_gender","hash_xxh64":"0x8BBC2A5EC4061DBF","variant_status":"runtime_gender_keys_target_same","male":"そうです！そこの保安官であるホーガン将軍はマスターの友人！彼の協力があれば、商談もスムーズにまとまるはずです！","female":"そうです！そこの保安官であるホーガン将軍はマスターの友人！彼の協力があれば、商談もスムーズにまとまるはずです！","variant_male_record_index":"139545","variant_female_record_index":"139546","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:14:1224415012:1":{"text":"それはいい考えだ。早速ボスに報告して、聖石町に先遣隊を送ってもらうよ。","source_cn":"好主意。我会上报给索尼娅，请她派先遣队前往圣石镇。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x657E32486B99E7D8","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:15:1224415013:1":{"text":"とはいえ、慌てて連絡をとらなくても大丈夫だぞ。","source_cn":"至于联络圣石镇的事，不着急。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x8E6EB1ED79AE96CF","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:16:1224415014:1":{"text":"えっ？船の修理はほとんど完成したのですよね？","source_cn":"哎？你们的船队不是修理得差不多了吗？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x4D8657DED5E7596F","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:17:1224415015:1":{"text":"先遣隊の船長が決まってないんだ。ブラッディ・マリーには、船を操縦できる者が少ないからな。","source_cn":"先遣队的领头人选还没定。血薇帮里，能领航的人不多。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x17F48AAB1D4B1CD0","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:20:1224415016:1":{"text":"確かに……あなたもソニアさんも、海に出るわけにはいきませんしね。","source_cn":"说的也是呢……你和索尼娅又不能亲自出海。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x3A595B5765B7578E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:23:1224415017:1":{"text":"海に出る？","source_cn":"出海？","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xDE407C3AFDD6280D","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:24:1224415018:1":{"text":"ベラ――ちょうどいい、お前に話があったんだ。","source_cn":"贝拉——既然你在，我就直说了。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x9687EDED039DD041","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:25:1224415019:1":{"text":"お前は航海術を心得ている。そこで、先遣隊を率いて航路の開拓に……","source_cn":"你懂领航。带领先遣队出航的任务，就交给——","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x7A943FE4622B5761","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:26:1224415020:1":{"text":"断ります。","source_cn":"别交给我，二当家。请恕我拒绝。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0xD4D0BFBBAEEEB6D3","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:27:1224415021:1":{"text":"……なぜだ？","source_cn":"……为什么？<key:dialog2>","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x008DE222E271B37E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_title":"","document_title_male":"","document_title_female":"","document_title_cn":"","document_title_status":""},"say:28:1224415022:1":{"text":"私にその任務は引き受けられません。いかなる処罰も受けます。","source_cn":"我没法完成这项任务。很抱歉，您要罚就罚吧。","status":"matched","hash_xxh64":"0x10A7D648FC48100E","variant_status":"","male":"","female":"","variant_male_record_index":"","variant_female_record_index":"","document_titl